</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2007</year>) <article-title>Epidemiology and clinical features of pneumonia according to radiographic findings in Gambian children</article-title>. <source>Trop Med Int Health</source><volume>12</volume>: <fpage>1377</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1385</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18045264</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0050100-Sazawal1"><label>26</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Sazawal</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Black</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name> (<year>2003</year>) <article-title>Effect of pneumonia case management on mortality in neonates, infants, and preschool children: a meta-analysis of community-based trials</article-title>. <source>Lancet Infect Dis</source><volume>3</volume>: <fpage>547</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>556</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12954560</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0050100-Hazir1"><label>27</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Hazir</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Nisar</surname><given-names>YB</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Abbasi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Ashraf</surname><given-names>YP</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Khurshid</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2011</year>) <article-title>Comparison of oral amoxicillin with placebo for the treatment of world health organization-defined nonsevere pneumonia in children aged 2&#x02013;59 months: a multicenter, double-blind, randomized, placebo-controlled trial in pakistan</article-title>. <source>Clin Infect Dis</source><volume>52</volume>: <fpage>293</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>300</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21189270</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0050100-Juven1"><label>28</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Juven</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Ruuskanen</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Mertsola</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name> (<year>2003</year>) <article-title>Symptoms and signs of community-acquired pneumonia in children</article-title>. <source>Scand J Prim Health Care</source><volume>21</volume>: <fpage>52</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>56</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12718462</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>